## 2026-08-03 — Sentence-by-sentence pass: every row stands alone

Reviewed all 18 table sentences against one test: does this survive being read
by someone who missed the row above it. Nine passed. Nine were leaning on a
neighbour, almost always via a bare "the" pointing at something only the
previous row defined.

Fixed:
